【来源1】{"claim": "Maria has been busy volunteering at the homeless shelter.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-17T11:01:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: Been busy volunteering at the homeless shelter and keeping fit. Just started doing aerial yoga, it's great. Have you tried any other cool workout classes?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源2】{"claim": "Maria is now friends with one of her fellow volunteers; they both love helping others.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: Hey John, great news - I'm now friends with one of my fellow volunteers! We both love helping others. How have you been since we last chatted?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源3】{"claim": "John notes his own kids have a lot while others don't, and says something needs to be done about it.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "John: It's definitely isn't, Maria. My kids have so much and others don't. We really need to do something about it.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源4】{"claim": "Maria volunteered at a shelter last week during an event for kids and describes it as a great experience.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: [Image: a photo of three women in green aprons holding pots and cups] Sure, it's not right that some kids get all they need while others have nothing to help them succeed. We gotta do something! Last week I volunteered at a shelter during an event for kids, and it's been a great experience.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "Last week", "start": "2023-01-16", "end_exclusive": "2023-01-23", "precision": "week", "rule": "iso_monday_week"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源5】{"claim": "Maria donated her old car to a homeless shelter where she volunteers, on 2022-12-21.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: Hey John, been a few days since we chatted. In the meantime, I donated my old car to a homeless shelter I volunteer at yesterday. How's the campaign going? I'm keen to hearabout it.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "yesterday", "start": "2022-12-21", "end_exclusive": "2022-12-22", "precision": "day", "rule": "source_relative_day"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源6】{"claim": "Maria usually watches movies, hikes, and has game nights at her place with friends.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: My fam's small, but I love spending time with the friends I have. We usually watch movies, hike, and have game nights at my place. Quality connections matter most to me.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源7】{"claim": "John has been busy with work and family.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a car with a broken windshield and a broken windshield] Hey Maria, I've been busy with work and family, but last week I had an unexpected incident on my way home. It reminded me how life can throw unexpected troubles our way.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "last week", "start": "2023-01-02", "end_exclusive": "2023-01-09", "precision": "week", "rule": "iso_monday_week"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源8】{"claim": "John's service-focused online group held events where members met in person, including going to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-01T20:30:00+00:00", "text": "John: We held some events and got to meet some people. We went to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies. Seeing the smiles on their faces, we knew we made a real difference. We also organized a toy drive for kids in need. It was amazing seeing the community come together to spread some joy.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源9】{"claim": "Maria started volunteering to help make a difference, inspired by her aunt who believed in volunteering and used to help her family when they were struggling.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: I started volunteering to help make a difference. My aunt believed in volunteering, and used to help my family out when we were struggling, so I'm inspired by her. It makes me happy knowing I can brighten somebody's day.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源10】{"claim": "Maria shared a photo of a table with pizzas and salads.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: [Image: a photo of a table with pizzas and salads on it] Yeah, John! It definitely builds a strong bond. Those shared meals really make life enjoyable and meaningful. What did you make?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源11】{"claim": "John was about to go do taekwondo after the chat on 2022-12-22.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "John: Yep, let's keep making great memories with our loved ones and cherishing the time we have. I'm off to do some taekwondo!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源12】{"claim": "John is brainstorming initiatives to help underserved communities get access to education, mentorship, job training, and resume building, with the goal of empowering individuals to achieve their aspirations.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-01T20:30:00+00:00", "text": "John: We're brainstorming some to help underserved communities get access to education, mentorship, job training, and resume building. The goal is to empower individuals in achieving their aspirations.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源13】{"claim": "Maria and John agree that kindness and compassion matter.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: Yep, kindness is key and a little compassion can really turn someone's day around. So glad we're on the same page here.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源14】{"claim": "John handled the unexpected car incident by staying calm and asking for assistance, which helped him get back safely.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "John: I tried to stay calm and asked for assistance, which helped me handle the situation and make it back safely.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源15】{"claim": "John found the community meeting interesting, hearing everyone's worries about how it affects their area.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a wooden floor with a white wall and a wooden floor] Hey Maria, since we last spoke I went to that community mtg. It was really interesting hearing everyone's worries and how it affects our area. It made me realize how crucial the upgrades are, especially for the kids. I'm really upset seeing the state of our education. How do you think we can make things better?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源16】{"claim": "Maria states that uniting is essential for making a difference and that standing together allows them to tackle any problems and build a great community.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: Agreed, John! Uniting is essential for making a difference. if we stand together we can tackle any problems and build a great community.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源17】{"claim": "John feels their kids lack the proper things they need and deserve better.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "John: Yup, education is essential for a successful society. I totally agree that we should fight for more money and resources for our schools. It breaks my heart that our kids don't have the proper stuff they need. They deserve better.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源18】{"claim": "John plans to chat with local leaders and organizations to get support and gather ideas for his next political move.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-17T11:01:00+00:00", "text": "John: I'm gonna chat with local leaders and organizations, get support and gather ideas for my next move.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
